
%% Statistical Comparison of Neural Activity Features
% This script compares multiple neural activity features between two event
% categories (e.g., global vs. local spindles, single vs. double SOs).
% For each recording session, it calculates summary statistics, performs
% significance testing (t-tests and circular statistics), and visualizes
% the results using histograms, polar plots, and session-wise comparison
% scatter plots. The analyzed features include amplitude, duration,
% firing rate, modulation index (MI), and phase-amplitude coupling (PAC).


